{"id":"wb-7-1046","name":"黄村进士第","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"黄村进士第","text":"黄村进士第位于中国安徽省黄山市休宁县商山镇黄村下门村，又称黄家大厅，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n黄村进士第建于明嘉靖十一年（1532年），由族人为嘉靖八年（1529年）已丑科进士黄福而建。黄村进士第占地面积约790平方米，四进五开间，面宽15.5米，进深51米，由前至后有门楼、门屋、享堂、寝楼。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E6%9D%91%E8%BF%9B%E5%A3%AB%E7%AC%AC","revisionId":86544658,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86544658","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0cf8772eac4d461f45568dd7.jpg","title":"Huangcun_Jinshidi,_2021-09-25_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huangcun_Jinshidi,_2021-09-25_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/Huangcun_Jinshidi%2C_2021-09-25_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​休宁黄村进士第","width":320,"height":214}}